CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'dwc->otg->state == OTG_STATE_A_HOST'
#131: FILE: drivers/usb/dwc3/core.c:831:
+	if ((dwc->otg->state == OTG_STATE_A_HOST) &&
+	    !(dwc->oevt & DWC3_OEVT_DEVICEMODE)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

